{% endfor %}

## Planning Rules
1. Break complex requests into the smallest logical steps
2. Identify dependencies between steps (which steps need results from others)
3. Mark steps that can run in parallel
4. Estimate whether each step requires human approval
5. Include error handling for each step (what to do if it fails)

## User Request
{{ user_message }}

## Response Format
Return a JSON plan with the following structure:
```json
{
  "plan_name": "descriptive name",
  "steps": [
    {
      "step_id": 1,
      "agent": "agent_name",
      "action": "what to do",
      "input": "input description",
      "depends_on": [],
      "requires_approval": false,
      "on_failure": "skip | retry | abort"
    }
  ]
}
```
